<title>DENMARK: Novo Nordisk 1996 profit soars.</title>
<headline>Novo Nordisk 1996 profit soars.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to December 31 1996</p>
<p>					  (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Group pre-tax result	     2,521  vs 2,156</p>
<p> Group net result		    1,799 vs 1,563</p>
<p> Group operating result	    2,386 vs 2,078</p>
<p> Group net turnover		 14,873 vs 13,723</p>
<p>Proposed dividend (Dkk per share) 3.75  vs 2.50</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Danish pharmaceuticals and biotechnology group is Novo Nordisk A/S. It said in a statement that it expected 1997 operating profits to be at least 15 percent up on 1996. The result was in line with average analyst expectations of a 1996 pre-tax profit of 2.515 billion crowns.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom, 45-33-969650</p>
